<title>UK: BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE STANDINGS AFTER FIRST PHASE.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE STANDINGS AFTER FIRST PHASE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings in the men's EuroLeague</p>
<p>basketball championship after Thursday's matches, the final</p>
<p>games of the opening phase. Note: In second phase, starting on</p>
<p>January 9, top three from each group play bottom three from</p>
<p>another group in another round-robin format (Group A v Group B;</p>
<p>Group C v Group D)</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p> Stefanel Milan (Italy)	    10  7  3  17</p>
<p> CSKA Moscow (Russia)		10  6  4  16</p>
<p> Maccabi Tel Aviv (Israel)	 10  6  4  16</p>
<p> Ulker Spor (Turkey)		 10  4  6  14</p>
